{"The calculation for totalPages is incorrect - using Math.floor(count / limit) + 1 results in an extra page when user_count is an exact multiple of limit (e.g., 100 users with limit of 50 would show 3 pages instead of 2). Should use Math.ceil instead.": 0.9651430249214172, "The findMembers method should return a resolved promise when the group name is empty to maintain API consistency. Returning undefined may cause errors in callers that expect a promise and attempt to chain with .then().": 0.8913307785987854, "The delete method on an ActiveRecord association collection expects an object or array of objects, not a raw ID. Passing a raw ID might not work as expected depending on Rails version and association type.": 0.8553813099861145, "Performing User.find_by_username inside a loop creates an N+1 query situation. Should fetch all users in a single query using User.where(username: usernames.split(\",\")) instead.": 0.6232134103775024}